## Overview

This project demonstrates the installation, configuration, and use of **osTicket** — a widely used open source helpdesk ticketing system similar to ServiceNow and Freshdesk. osTicket was installed on DC01 (Windows Server 2022) using XAMPP as the web server stack, and accessed from Client01 (Windows 10) to simulate a real-world helpdesk environment.

The project covers the full ticket lifecycle — from installation and configuration through to raising, assigning, resolving, and closing tickets.

